# W31i, host a (k10): hosts Dry Land; with b and c in stag0201 a goes into dng204b1 alone (matz01) and waits there until
# b joins it (b's second request, sent right after its arrival in stag0202).
campaign until stage=stagml11,control
idle until epoch>=@80
explore mate00 until onme:mate00
gate mate00 1 until stage=stag0201,control
log a hosts Dry Land
idle until present=3,sealed>=300 or epoch>=@420 fail stagechange
log b and c joined
explore matz01 yes until stage=dng204b1,control fail epoch>=@800
log a in dng204b1
disk 1 until hp>=700 or frames>=600
idle until present=2,sealed>=300 fail epoch>=@1300
log b joined a in B1
idle until frames>=120
